  "notes": "This LER concerns degradation of an embedded flaw repair on RVCH nozzle penetration 74, not the original PWSCC indication (that was the subject of the June 2021 predecessor LER). Cause code B (Design/Manufacturing/Installation) reflects the official coding despite the narrative attributing cause to operational thermal/pressure stresses acting on pre-existing subsurface discontinuities from the repair weld deposition process. Exact LER numbers for the two referenced previous events were not given in the narrative (only month/year and unit); stub keys are placeholders per instructions since specific numbers were not stated -- flagged as uncertain identifiers."
